the knowledge base us_statutes_7_2014_e_2_b includes:


% 7 U.S.C. 2014(e)(2)(B) — us:statutes/7/2014/e/2/B
the text of "7 USC 2014(e)(2)(B)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2014/e/2/B.yaml".

the snap earned income deduction rate is 0.2 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

scenario earned_income_deduction_rate_is_twenty_percent is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2014/e/2/B.test.yaml" at case 1:
    household_1 is a household.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    q_snap_earned_income_deduction_rate expects answers ["the snap earned income deduction rate is 0.2"].

query q_snap_earned_income_deduction_rate is:
    the snap earned income deduction rate is which rate.

